    "message": "[ipa-delivery:725] build(delivery): private IPA 725 = the delivered 724 with RPCS3 Core 928, MeloNX Core 731 + five-part MoltenVK, skins PR 171/173, imports and launch prerequisites\n\nFrozen on 603ee05d: effective digest 2b7d639b, 7629 product files, 0 conflicts, 0 unclassified\ncommits, legal check passed; base the delivered 724 (run 42914845416, IPA c3fcb1c7). Components:\nRPCS3 Core 928 replaced (pin f37dae63, run 42960159566), MeloNX Core 731 replaced (pin 77b53db7,\nrun 42958274015) with MeloNX MoltenVK standalone rebuilt by the five-part recipe patch\n(99605a2b); Dolphin, ARMSX2, libretro and MeloNX dependencies retained. Seven reviewed commits that\ntouch files still carrying the deferred b06888a9 lines reach the build through the port\n(7c9766bd, e51e07ce, 7656eb59). Both test groups fresh. Nothing of this build observed on an iPhone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
